            "sid": "DEU 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pandaŵi jelejo namsalile Yoswa kuti, ‘Ana eti mlolite yosope yatesile AMBUJE Mlungu jwetu pakutukamucisya kwajonanga ayimwene ŵaŵili ŵala Ogi ni Sihoni. AMBUJEWO tatende yalumope ni mwenye jwalijose jutimkamenyane najo ngondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo mkasimja kutenda woga kumenyana nawo, ligongo AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu takamkamucisye kuputa ngondo ni kwajonanga amagongo ŵenu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mose ngakumkunda kwinjila mcilambo ca Kenani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
